@gen.lang.common.note core.note
    text="Seeded by scripts/build-lang-common.mjs from the union of the per-world lead-in and suffix lists (unreachable alternatives removed) and the per-world shared lexicons; edit by hand from now on. New common phrasing goes here, never inline in a world."

